### What the CNC Settings Panel Contains

`src/features/settings/cnc-settings-panel.tsx`:

**Currently contains ONLY tool parameter overrides:**
- Per-tool collapsible sections (T7, T9, T11)
- Tool parameters: diameter, gauge_length, flutes, spindle_rpm, feed_cut, feed_plunge
